<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="set-bonuses">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Fury Warriors in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Tier 15 bonuses are relatively straightforward for Fury Warriors. The 2-piece grants your melee auto attacks a chance to activate <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=12880/enrage">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unholyfrenzy.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enrage</span></a>. Unfortunately, the 2-piece is not as strong as it sounds for Fury, as the proc-per-minute is relatively low. <br/>
<br/>Unlike the 2-piece, the 4-piece bonus is very strong. When you use <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=1719/recklessness">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_criticalstrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Recklessness</span></a>, you gain an additional 35% Critical Strike for 10 seconds. Originally, this set bonus was intended to activate when you used <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=114207/skull-banner">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/warrior_skullbanner.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skull Banner</span></a>, but Blizzard decided to change the 4-set this time around, as you shouldn't be incentivized to prioritize your own Skull Banner usage over the raid’s overall damage.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 15 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1172/battleplate-of-the-last-mogu">
