<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Fury Warrior Trinkets in Phase 3</span></h2>DPS trinkets tend to be very straightforward. When it comes to the best DPS trinkets in phase 3, there are clear winners and losers. There are, unfortunately, no competitive on-use trinkets in Phase 3, so you will be aiming to run two proc trinkets.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>Warriors should typically use one on-use and one passive trinket, or two passive trinkets, but rarely ever two on-use.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Active Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=93256/skullrender-medallion">
